gantt
    title InferBench Framework - Project Timeline (v2, July 2026)
    dateFormat  YYYY-MM-DD

    section Phase 1-8 Completed (Nov 2025 - Jan 2026)
    Core Framework (recipes, SLURM, Apptainer)  :done, c1, 2025-11-01, 40d
    Server-Client-Monitor-Logs Modules          :done, c2, 2025-11-20, 35d
    Web Dashboard and REST API                  :done, c3, 2025-12-22, 10d
    MeluXina Deployment and Initial Benchmarks  :done, c4, 2026-01-05, 8d

    section Phase 9 Framework v1.1 Hardening
    Static bench client (no codegen)            :done, h1, 2026-07-13, 1d
    Statistics fixes (interpolated percentiles) :done, h2, 2026-07-13, 1d
    Config portability (env-driven services)    :done, h3, 2026-07-13, 1d
    Test suite green (138 tests)                :done, h4, 2026-07-13, 1d

    section Phase 10 Measurement Campaign (Completed)
    Regain MeluXina access                      :done, m1, 2026-07-20, 5d
    Repetition study (n=10 per model)           :done, m2, after m1, 2d
    Concurrency sweep (Ollama)                  :done, m3, after m2, 2d
    vLLM deployment and comparative sweep       :done, m4, after m3, 3d
    Replace measured results with measured data :done, m5, after m4, 2d

    section Phase 11 Final Deliverables (dates TBD)
    Final report update                         :d1, after m5, 4d
    Poster and presentation refresh             :d2, after d1, 3d
    Submission                                  :milestone, d3, after d2, 0d
